{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/100807-sensing-angels-and-matrices","id":100807,"title":"Sensing Angels and Matrices","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-28T11:34:33-07:00","id":100807,"title":"Sensing Angels and Matrices","content":"So, I'm finishing putting together my notes for a city and I'm trying to sort out some logistical questions in my head. Some of these I'm probably overthinking, and some might have answers I've missed. But they weigh on me.<br /> <br /> What's the disadvantage to an angel being in twilight? It seems like the only way they can be detected while they're in that state is aetheric resonance, which isn't enough to really confront them, just enough to be aware there's potentially a watcher somewhere nearby. Isn't it optimal for demon-seeking angel teams to operate from twilight until they manifest to fight, or at least have spotters operating from twilight? This is probably more of a feature then a bug but I'm trying to wrap my head around the implications.<br /> <br /> Can demons use abjurations? Should they take modifiers equivalent to the Integrity mods for high and low cover? What if they're trying to use abjuration while they're in demonic form?<br /> <br /> How broadly sensitive is a demon's awareness of an occult matrix forming? What's the range - anything sensory? If they see an outpost of a mortal cult that's gathering resources for a matrix, do they immediately sense that something's going on? Or does the group need to be actively gathering resources at the time? There's probably a degree of ST interpretation here, so I'm asking as much about opinions and ramifications as I am rules-as-written.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1134-nicias","name":"Nicias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"274"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-29T09:19:15-07:00","id":101326,"title":"","content":"I don't there is a disadvantage, other than the pain of materializing. Of course that means demons need to be especially nervous if they detect Aether but no source. Watchers can follow them anywhere, learn where they live and then send something to deal with them. Paranoia is very much a feature of Demon.<br /> <br /> I suppose they could use Abjurations. Using Cover to determine modifiers seems sensible. I don't know that I'd allow them to use abjurations while in demonic form though.<br /> <br /> Not sure on the occult matrix. I kind of think they need to be looking.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/463-derendel","name":"Derendel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar463_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}